@Groovy-Train kinda, it's still more than 2 slots, but yeah, it and the reaper for now are.

The reaper is the only properly sized card. 200mm by 110mm(standard width) by 38mm(2 slots). 
Sapphire is 240mm(standard dual fan length) by 120mm by 46mm(more than dual slot).

@Groovy-Train it's not about space, but weight and leverage on top of covering ports and other parts of the motherboard.

GPU sag is not good. 

And you can always get a DP to HDMI converter for a few bucks, but yeah. Sapphire would be the choice if it was a bit smaller and lighter.
